Z||000000||My7Fieros||02-16-2001||02:25 PM||||A while back I posted some before and after pics of my Formula restoration project. Well I came across a few more. These are some when the work was in progress....<BR>Heres one of the day I bought it...yuk!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MyFieroBeforeA_1.jpg"> <BR>About halfway through w/ new front end.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MyFormulaBefore1.jpg"> <BR>DID SOMEBODY SAY MCDONALDS!? lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MyFormulaBefore3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MyFormulaBefore4.jpg"> <BR>Ahhh...much better!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-009f_5.jpg"> <BR>Unfortunantly she's started running rough and is taking a well deserved break until the weather gets nicer until I can get back to work on her!<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://tgowens.com/My7Fieros_sig.gif"> ||||reg||10
